// MathNet Problem: 095q
@Competition: A 62 - A OLIMPIADĂ DE MATEMATICĂ A REPUBLICII MOLDOVA
@Topic: Geometry > Solid Geometry > 3D Shapes

// State space for mathematical reasoning
State(4096) → reasoning_space
WaveState(2048) → solution_wave

// Problem: Problem:

Fie cubul $ABCD A_{1} B_{1} C_{1} D_{1}$. Punctul $K$ este un punct interior al muchiei $B B_{1}$ astfel încât $BK / K B_{1} = m$. Prin punctele $K$ și $C_{1}$ este trasat un plan $\alpha$, ...

// Apply reasoning transform
reasoning_space @ W_initial >> LayerNorm

// Attention over solution candidates
Attention(query=reasoning_space, memory=solution_wave)

// Entropy gate to collapse to correct solution
⊕EntropyGate(threshold=0.3)

// Answer: a) A1P/PB1 = |m − 1|, i.e. m > 1: m − 1; m = 1: 0; 0 < m < 1: 1 − m.
b) The volume ratio of the two parts (V_part1/V_part2) is:
- for m ≥ 1: 1 / (6 m^2 + 6 m − 1);
- for 0 < m ≤ 1: (3 − 3 m + m^2) / (3 + 9 m − m^2).
